# Alembic migrations

Database schema migrations live here.

## Common commands

```bash
# Generate a new migration from current models
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

# Apply migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Roll back one revision
alembic downgrade -1
```

Generated revision files land in `versions/`. Each file is a forward
(`upgrade`) and backward (`downgrade`) step applied to the database.
